//  US_DTWEXBGS 10  (126.5/122 − 1)×100 = 3.6885 ≥ 2 → fx.chg3m.ge2 {ov .4, st .3} → ov 4, st 3
//  US_CPI_YOY  15  2.9 → infl.2to3 {rec .4, ov .3, st .1, recess .1} → 6 / 4.5 / 1.5 / 1.5
